        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0170_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "33EEE0F1D25A25A0",
      "text": "Pues ya te has ventilado a todo el Alto Mando.\\nMadre mía...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0170_dragonbb_a_01",
      "hash64": "51F5E05D5F890E12",
      "text": "¿Sabes? Aunque Denis tenga una forma más\\nsimple de ver la vida, no significa que combatir\\r\\nse le dé peor que al resto de nosotros.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0170_dragonbb_a_02",
      "hash64": "51F5DF5D5F890C5F",
      "text": "Tener una perspectiva más sencilla de las cosas\\nno tiene por qué ser malo.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0170_dragonbb_a_03",
      "hash64": "51F5DE5D5F890AAC",
      "text": "Recuerdo cuando nos juntábamos todos tras las\\nactividades del club para comer lo que hubiese\\r\\npreparado Denis ese día. Qué tiempos aquellos...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0170_dragonbb_a_04",
      "hash64": "51F5DD5D5F8908F9",
      "text": "Él también lo estará pasando mal últimamente,\\ncomo todos los demás.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0170_dragonbb_b_01",
      "hash64": "AC70A076A7EEF725",
      "text": "Nerina es una tía muy curiosa, ¿verdad?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0170_dragonbb_b_02",
      "hash64": "AC709D76A7EEF20C",
      "text": "Me parto cuando la veo hablando con Corin.\\c\\nEs asombroso lo bien que se complementan,\\n¡parecen un dúo cómico![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0170_dragonbb_b_03",
      "hash64": "AC709E76A7EEF3BF",
      "text": "Bajo la fachada formal y estricta de Nerina\\nse esconde una chica muy sensible, ¿sabes?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0170_dragonbb_b_04",
      "hash64": "AC709B76A7EEEEA6",
      "text": "Su forma de ser suele provocar malentendidos.\\nSolo te lo digo para que no la malinterpretes...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0170_dragonbb_c_01",
      "hash64": "D5A8946B5D717070",
      "text": "A Aroa le flipan las cosas monas, y esa ha sido\\nla clave para llegar a ser una Entrenadora\\r\\nincreíblemente fuerte.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0170_dragonbb_c_02",
      "hash64": "D5A8976B5D717589",
      "text": "Lo que a muchos les supondría un esfuerzo\\ntremendo, a ella no le cuesta nada porque le\\r\\nencanta pasar tiempo con sus Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0170_dragonbb_c_03",
      "hash64": "D5A8966B5D7173D6",
      "text": "Aunque, bueno, en ese sentido tú eres parecid[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa\\na ella, ¿no, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
